    "detailed_description": "<h1>Workshop!</h1><p>Share your brushes with each other through steam workshop!</p><br><h1>About the Software</h1>Create palettes in seconds through ramps and functions<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/c67a4293963b373a88879630e17a096c.poster.avif?t=1725004310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/c67a4293963b373a88879630e17a096c.webm?t=1725004310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/c67a4293963b373a88879630e17a096c.mp4?t=1725004310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Import images as reference images, to sample the colors directly, or to sample the 5 most prominent colors<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/2a295b100eaed4bf94aa21f8027d23eb.poster.avif?t=1725004310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/2a295b100eaed4bf94aa21f8027d23eb.webm?t=1725004310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/2a295b100eaed4bf94aa21f8027d23eb.mp4?t=1725004310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Import and paint onto models using your selected colors, then export and use anywhere else<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/97dc5f51464438ed0c741bfd26d4a0eb.poster.avif?t=1725004310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/97dc5f51464438ed0c741bfd26d4a0eb.webm?t=1725004310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/97dc5f51464438ed0c741bfd26d4a0eb.mp4?t=1725004310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Paint whole rooms with ease!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/9bd4e6cd5608fd8306ef453ac35b609d.poster.avif?t=1725004310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/9bd4e6cd5608fd8306ef453ac35b609d.webm?t=1725004310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/9bd4e6cd5608fd8306ef453ac35b609d.mp4?t=1725004310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Paint with different layers<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/afc470619a84fca0ccbc4a4f63ba202c.poster.avif?t=1725004310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/afc470619a84fca0ccbc4a4f63ba202c.webm?t=1725004310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/afc470619a84fca0ccbc4a4f63ba202c.mp4?t=1725004310\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>And groups<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/5dced2906bd4e31798fbd1176ae8f422.poster.avif?t=1725004310\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/5dced2906bd4e31798fbd1176ae8f422.webm?t=1725004310\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1976160/extras/5dced29